XLADP OUTP VCM P4 P16 VSS fdda_ladder
XLADN OUTN VCM N4 N16 VSS fdda_ladder
* Sense-only transmission gates: no intended DC resistor current through them.
XSP1 OUTP FBP E1 E1B VDD VSS frontend_gain_tgate
XSN1 OUTN FBN E1 E1B VDD VSS frontend_gain_tgate
XSP4 P4 FBP E4 E4B VDD VSS frontend_gain_tgate
